#: ../../SpinalHDL/Data types/SVIF.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``SVIF`` type specifically targets system Verilog designs. This type "
"extends from ``Bundle``. When generating Verilog or VHDL, the behavior of"
" this type is exactly the same as that of ``Bundle``. However, when "
"generating System Verilog and enabling the ``svInterface`` option in "
"SpinalConfig, this type will be generated as an ``Interface``."
msgstr ""

