#: ../../SpinalHDL/Data types/SVIF.rst:171
msgid ""
"If you have used a certain interface in multiple places, and at one of "
"those locations ``mySignal``, you wish to flatten it instead of "
"generating an interface, you can achieve this by calling "
"``mySignal.notSVIF()`` to fully flatten the signal. If the signal has "
"nested interfaces and you only want to expand the outermost layer, you "
"can use ``mySignal.notSVIFthisLevel()``."
msgstr ""

